# Vulnerability details

## Impact
When a nominee is removed its left over bias/weight is subtracted from the global weights but the amount of slope contributed by the removed nominee is not removed from the global value of total slope due to which in upcoming weeks the total left over weight of the removed nominee will be once again reduced from the global/total weights thus causing double subtraction of weights of removed nominee. This causes wrong calculation of weights and relative weights of nominee and ultimately affecting staking incentives of each nominee.

