The function the protocol uses does not check whether the call comes from the messenger contract. Instead, it checks that the L2Dispenser is the xDomainMessageSender().

In Optimism CrossDomainMessenger.sol, it states that the xDomainMessageSender will be set if there's a message being routed.

```
